  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>,&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#8658;</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8800;0</mo></math>&nbsp;(suppose)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>}</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><br />Equating real and imaginary parts<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br />Dividing the two equations, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8658;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;then from original equation&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>w</mi></menclose><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>)</p>"
  }
